          }
        ],
        "text": "Yes, sir!...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u004",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d003",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 46,
            "printedPage": 38
          }
        ],
        "text": "All right, go!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u005",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 46,
            "printedPage": 38
          }
        ],
        "text": "(The boy leaves. Pandiyan enters. Seeing Pandiyan's sorrowful face, Punyakodi comes near him.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d004",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 46,
            "printedPage": 38
          }
        ],
        "text": "What is it, son? Why are you sad?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u007",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 46,
            "printedPage": 38
          }
        ],
        "text": "Nothing, father!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u008",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d006",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 46,
            "printedPage": 38
          }
        ],
        "text": "You were happy all through yesterday! What is it again now?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u009",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d007",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 46,
            "printedPage": 38
          }
        ],
        "text": "I have no worries.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u010",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d008",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 46,
            "printedPage": 38
          }
        ],
        "text": "Hmm...Pandiyan! There was something I wanted to tell you!...hmm....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u011",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d009",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 46,
            "printedPage": 38
          }
        ],
        "text": "(A little startled) What is it, father?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u012",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d010",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 46,
            "printedPage": 38
          }
        ],
        "text": "That...that....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u013",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 46,
            "printedPage": 38
          }
        ],
        "text": "(He shows him a photograph of a woman.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u014",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d011",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 46,
            "printedPage": 38
          }
        ],
        "text": "Look at this!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u015",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d012",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 46,
            "printedPage": 38
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Looking at the picture) Father! I don't want marriage at all!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u016",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d013",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "All right, you don't want it...but this girl....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u017",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d014",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "Whoever she is, I don't need it.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u018",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d015",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "Why are you in such a hurry, son? That girl is desperately longing!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u019",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d016",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "Let her long! So what?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u020",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d017",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "I'm saying the girl is willing.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u021",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d018",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "Oh no, what trouble is this!...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u022",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d019",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "There's no trouble...people in town will shout that an old man shouldn't marry...that's why I'm telling you all this.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u023",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d020",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "I don't want marriage now! I won't want marriage even when I'm old!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u024",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d021",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "Hey, not for you, not for you! Forget that! I'm talking about myself!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u025",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d022",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "Father! The marriage is for you?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u026",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d023",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "Why are you surprised? Is this the eighth wonder of the world?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u027",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d024",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "When did this desire come to you, father?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u028",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d025",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "Yes, boy! What a fine question! When did desire come, you ask? As though I have written down the year, month and date. You're asking for the horoscope of desire.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u029",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d026",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "Even if desire has no horoscope, there is a horoscope to prove that you have crossed sixty, father!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u030",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d027",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "Impertinent fellow!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u031",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d028",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 47,
            "printedPage": 39
          }
        ],
        "text": "Father! Don't ruin a young woman's life!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u032",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d029",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "Fool! I'm going to give a young woman a life! Don't rave without understanding! No one will marry this girl. She is mute!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u033",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d030",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "This mad society turns even women who can speak into silent women; would it leave mute women alive?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u034",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d031",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "So what do you say now?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u035",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d032",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "I ask you to change your decision.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u036",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d033",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "Impossible! You are the one who must change your decision. I was born before you!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u037",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d034",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "Who denies it! You're at the age to fondle grandchildren!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u038",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d035",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "After I brought you into the world, raised and protected you, and made you a man, is this how you should talk back to me?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u039",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d036",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "For that I offer you a thousand salutations. But at the age when you should be handing over the garland at your son's wedding, you say you will become the bridegroom yourself; I can never permit that!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u040",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d037",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "Bah! Who are you to permit me? I'll do as I please.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u041",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d038",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "Don't do it, father—don't make this disastrous decision!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u042",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d039",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "Bah! Don't speak to me!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u043",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d040",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "Your marriage?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u044",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d041",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "I'm going through with it.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u045",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d042",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "Have you come to hate me?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u046",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d043",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 48,
            "printedPage": 40
          }
        ],
        "text": "I'll drive you out.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u047",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d044",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 49,
            "printedPage": 41
          }
        ],
        "text": "You don't have to drive me out. I'll go myself.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u048",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d045",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 49,
            "printedPage": 41
          }
        ],
        "text": "Get out! Don't show your face to me again! Go!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u049",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பாண்டியன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d046",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 49,
            "printedPage": 41
          }
        ],
        "text": "I'm going. May your intoxication clear soon. (He leaves.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s037-u050",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s037-d047",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 49,
            "printedPage": 41
          }
        ],
        "text": "Go on, go! 'May your intoxication clear,' he says. As though I'm sitting here drunk!",
        "notes": [
          "The source plays on Pandiyan's figurative `போதை` and Punyakodi's literal retort about drinking; the contrast is preserved explicitly."
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
